Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:49.90,Comment_Bad,Chris,0,0,0,CommentDialogueTable|60005_11_C1,...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:50.90,Comment_Bad,Orca,0,0,0,CommentDialogueTable|60005_12_C1,Danke, Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:51.90,Comment_Bad,Orca,0,0,0,CommentDialogueTable|60005_13_C1,Die Toilette ist wirklich sauber. Haha …
